  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En el Mes de la Prevención, el equipo SENDA se encuentra desarrollando talleres y actividades comunitarias en los sectores focalizados de Ten Ten y El Empalme.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏡\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t77/1/16/1f3e1.png\"/> Estas jornadas buscan fortalecer la prevención, promover estilos de vida saludables y planificar junto a vecinos y vecinas acciones que contribuyan al bienestar y desarrollo de sus comunidades.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"💙\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/1f499.png\"/> El trabajo colaborativo y la participación de la comunidad son fundamentales para seguir construyendo entornos más seguros y saludables para todos.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-41 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10418\" data-id=\"10418\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/yjxa20acrwaq9st/adultos_01_1024x683_whv78kz34t.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10420\" data-id=\"10420\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/9sfw3pfxjdnt7tv/adultos_02_1024x683_ye331n6b75.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10421\" data-id=\"10421\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/bopsq78lybek4sq/adultos_03_1024x683_a6mr6o91j1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10416\" data-id=\"10416\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/bem8owb1ws6apky/adultos_04_1024x683_hxygv9x5h7.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10415\" data-id=\"10415\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ogbofr2ucvi0b4a/adultos_05_1024x683_u8u7y8zgyd.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10423\" data-id=\"10423\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/qni51kk0kpfejkp/adultos_06_1024x683_dt2ggcetes.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10419\" data-id=\"10419\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ycy1n7liolc5k5w/adultos_09_1024x683_a8x0eomleo.webp\" loading=\"lazy